@startuml
actor Human
participant CLI
participant Planner
participant Scheduler
participant "AEO-1C Gate" as Gate
participant "AEO-2 Executor" as Executor
Human -> CLI: plan existing milestone
CLI -> Planner: validate exact approved graph
Planner -> Gate: verify design and scope
Planner --> Human: immutable plan for review
Human -> CLI: approve exact plan
CLI -> Scheduler: prepare eligible requests
Scheduler --> Human: exact execution requests
Human -> CLI: authenticate execution grants
CLI -> Scheduler: execute
Scheduler -> Gate: recheck design
Scheduler -> Scheduler: claim tasks and sorted resources
par independent task A
Scheduler -> Executor: approved execution A
else independent task B
Scheduler -> Executor: approved execution B
end
Executor --> Scheduler: structured results and validation
Scheduler -> Scheduler: persist evidence and release leases
@enduml
